# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .gitignore for the Aegis Flask application.
#
# UNLIKE a normal repo, this one intentionally commits its demo data
# (soc_db/, chroma_db/, *.db) so the app has something to show without a
# live NetWitness/VPN connection - useful for offline development and
# demos. (This is no longer because of a Streamlit Cloud deployment -
# that path was removed entirely in Phase 7; the demo-data rationale on
# its own still applies and is kept.) Only secrets and throwaway cruft
# are ignored.
#
# ⚠️  The stored incidents may contain internal hostnames/users/IPs. If
#     this data is not entirely synthetic, treat it as sensitive: do not
#     push this repository to a public remote without first verifying/
#     scrubbing it, or deploy from a PRIVATE repo. See DEPLOY.md.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── SECRETS — never commit; use local environment variables ──
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── NetWitness TLS material (on-prem/VPN only; sensitive, unused in cloud) ──
*.pem
*.cer
certs/

# ── Transient SQLite sidecars (commit the .db, not its WAL/journal) ────────
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal

# ── Python / editor / OS cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.bak
*.log
# Office lock files (created while a Word/Excel/PowerPoint document is open)
~$*

# ── Redundant packaged agent copies ────────────────────────────────────────
*.zip

# ── Knowledge-graph artifacts (rebuild with /graphify) ─────────────────────
graphify-out/

# ── Regenerated at runtime (not needed in the repo) ────────────────────────
agents/reporting/outputs/
agents/reporting/logs/
agents/reporting/runtime/
agents/investigation/ChromaDatabase/
runtime/uploads/*
!runtime/uploads/.gitkeep
runtime/chroma/

# NOTE: soc_db/, chroma_db/, *.db, incident_reports/, triaged_alerts/ are
# intentionally TRACKED — they are the offline demo payload the cloud app
# reads. Do not add them here.
